		{"id":"9505254955e31e1a","type":"text","text":"`set_key(...)`\n\n向指定的`dotenv_path`里写入指定的键值对","x":-1100,"y":-2960,"width":450,"height":158,"color":"#00ff00"},
		{"id":"4a4aadd254434173","type":"text","text":"判断一下键值对是否需要引号。\n\n- 若`quote_mode`是`always`，一定加引号\n- 若`quote_mode`是`auto`，\n\t- 若需要设置的值是全数字，则不需要\n\t- 非全数字，需要加括号","x":-500,"y":-3016,"width":340,"height":271},
		{"id":"9b039fdd922f34cb","type":"text","text":"将值里的单引号转义，再加上一对单引号","x":67,"y":-3056,"width":250,"height":96},
		{"id":"b78690b097f4ff6d","type":"text","text":"`get_key(...)`\n\n传入`dotenv_path`，得到其中的`key_to_get`所代表的值","x":-1100,"y":-3240,"width":450,"height":159,"color":"#00ff00"},
		{"id":"061d9c0af47ccc14","type":"text","text":"`_load_dotenv_disabled(…)`\n\n读取环境变量`PYTHON_DOTENV_DISABLED`的值判断用户是否允许load .env文件","x":-1100,"y":-3520,"width":450,"height":199,"color":"#00ff00"},
		{"id":"ef9de975e0d77779","type":"text","text":"`with_warn_for_invalid_lines(...)`\n\n对于不合法的行打印错误信息的日志。\n\n建立的又一层生成器，将错误信息打印和处理写入数据的逻辑分离","x":-1100,"y":-3840,"width":450,"height":200,"color":"#00ff00"},
		{"id":"4bd72eeba56373c6","type":"text","text":"`rewrite(...)`\n\n把`path`的原始数据读取出来然后交给用户进行操作之后再写入新的文件\n","x":-1100,"y":-2580,"width":450,"height":140,"color":"#00ff00"},
		{"id":"f37755fb8bb6c4d8","x":780,"y":-2558,"width":250,"height":102,"type":"text","text":"更改`dst`的`mode`，实现文件权限的拷贝"},
		{"id":"39608858b4467e36","x":-455,"y":-2549,"width":250,"height":85,"type":"text","text":"找到`path`，特别是需要处理软连接的情况"},
		{"id":"6dda52776702f54e","x":-40,"y":-2555,"width":289,"height":98,"type":"text","text":"获取`path`代表的原始数据`source`和这个原始数据的文件权限"},
		{"id":"f068c4d6361357ba","x":420,"y":-2576,"width":250,"height":138,"type":"text","text":"用`tempfile`创建临时文件`dst`，然后把`source`和`dst`的处理权交给用户"},
		{"id":"4b9b5c9926b8a155","x":1140,"y":-2537,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#ff0000","type":"text","text":"原子替换文件"},
		{"id":"d9f4ec6e747596f1","x":460,"y":-2911,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"得到合法的值"},
		{"id":"41ef4bdd22552bb4","x":905,"y":-2805,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"直接得到最终的行"},
		{"id":"1e41e57ba2131f5d","x":905,"y":-3056,"width":250,"height":109,"type":"text","text":"加上`export`并得到最终插入的行"},
		{"id":"51a245b9fc13f7f5","x":1794,"y":-3031,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"修改后替换"},
		{"id":"3abcba9cebaf9ce6","x":1320,"y":-2961,"width":250,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"调用`rewrite`，一行一行地读取原来文件里的键值对，判断修改的键是否已经存在"},
